{"ID":"20240205164747-y5sfhbf","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240205164747-y5sfhbf","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205164747-y5sfhbf\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206102010-nls6qp6\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240611101749-14ym058\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:3574,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240611101730-e1f8ghe\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:17,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:17\u0026#125;","title":"135鸡头实（芡实）","type":"doc","updated":"20240812111046"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206102010-nls6qp6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206102010-nls6qp6","updated":"20240206102017"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产于江苏、湖南、湖北、山东等地。\n【性状】\t类球形，多为破粒。表面有棕红色内种皮，一端黄自色，约占全体1/3、有凹点状的种脐痕，除去内种皮显白色。质较硬，断面白色，粉性。气微，味淡。\n【性味】\t甘、涩。平。\n【功效】\t益肾固精，补脾止渭，除湿止带。用于遗精滑精，遗尿尿频，脾虚久泻，自浊，带下。"}]},{"ID":"20240206102011-6r0tm4o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206102011-6r0tm4o","updated":"20240206102011"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206102011-dcy0pgr.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205165318-ln84p4f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205165318-ln84p4f","updated":"20240205165318"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"芡实"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/芡实-20240205165318-gzok8qx.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]}]},{"ID":"20240621132106-dokqs4k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240621132106-dokqs4k","updated":"20240812104746"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 610px;","style":"width: 600px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"芡实 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/芡实 3-20240812104744-vmjj2gt.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 600px;\" parent-style=\"width: 610px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240812104711-h47k4z7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240812104711-h47k4z7","updated":"20240812104831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 611px;","style":"width: 601px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"芡实 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/芡实 2-20240812104655-u2uh1nv.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 601px;\" parent-style=\"width: 611px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 616px;","style":"width: 606px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"芡实 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/芡实 4-20240812104831-u57wcrx.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 606px;\" parent-style=\"width: 616px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240812110257-6knxf5i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240812110257-6knxf5i","updated":"20240812110305"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 802px;","style":"width: 792px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"N